---
import DotField from '../atmosphere/DotField.astro';
---
<section id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading" class="relative border-t border-rule py-24 md:py-32">

  <!-- Ambient dot field — decorative background, z-index 0 -->
  <DotField />

  <!-- Content — sits above dot field -->
  <div class="relative z-10 grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_240px] gap-16 md:gap-24 items-start">

    <!-- Main column -->
    <div>
      <header class="mb-10 fade-up">
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] text-ink-3 mb-3">// 01 — ABOUT</p>
        <h2
          id="about-heading"
          class="font-serif font-light text-[clamp(1.6rem,3.2vw,2.6rem)] text-ink leading-snug"
          style="font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 72"
        >
          About
        </h2>
      </header>

      <div class="space-y-5 text-ink-2 leading-relaxed fade-up delay-1">
        <p>I lead AI strategy and transformation at Profitable Ideas Exchange, where I established the firm's AI capabilities and continue to direct its strategy, investments, and adoption.</p>
        <p>The work spans technology decisions, governance, workflow redesign, and organizational change. I lead our AI Task Force, work with C-suite leadership, and present recommendations, results, and investment proposals to senior leadership and the Board. I also build AI agents and automations, run pilots, and work with teams to make the technology useful in their daily operations.</p>
        <p>Alongside AI, I lead executive advisory boards and peer communities. My work at PIE has included programs for Deloitte, IBM, and BDO. These programs bring me into regular conversations with CIOs, CISOs, CTOs, CAIOs, and other senior leaders about the challenges facing their organizations. I interview hundreds of executives annually, facilitate discussions, and develop reports that help clients understand their customers, strengthen relationships, and inform business strategy.</p>
        <p>Earlier in my career, I managed operations across three facilities with more than 100 employees and co-founded a consumer products business. Those experiences continue to shape how I approach technology investments and organizational change.</p>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Marginalia column -->
    <aside aria-label="Related context" class="fade-up delay-2">
      <div class="border-l border-rule pl-6 space-y-8 text-xs font-mono text-ink-3">

        <div>
          <p class="tracking-[0.14em] uppercase mb-2 text-ink-2">Current role</p>
          <p class="leading-relaxed">Director<br/>Profitable Ideas Exchange<br/>June 2023–Present<br/>Bozeman, Montana</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="tracking-[0.14em] uppercase mb-2 text-ink-2">What I build</p>
          <p class="leading-relaxed">Internal AI agents<br/>Evaluation frameworks<br/>Governance structures</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="tracking-[0.14em] uppercase mb-2 text-ink-2">Background</p>
          <p class="leading-relaxed">More than 10 years across consulting, operations, product development, executive programs, and AI transformation</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="tracking-[0.14em] uppercase mb-2 text-ink-2">Where to find me</p>
          <a href="mailto:kc@kevinclark.ai" class="link-draw text-ink-2">kc@kevinclark.ai</a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </aside>

  </div>
</section>
